WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.100
Bradford, England, 1985.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.400
A small fire started in rubbish under an old wooden stand.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.700
Within minutes the stand was alight, and some exits were locked.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.600
Fifty-six people died.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:24.300
Rubbish and locked exits - two things someone could have found before the match.

